OL,3,ASpanish prime minister calls snap
OL,4,Aelection after housing protests
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpanish PM Pedro Sanchez has called a
OL,7,Fsnap election days after Congress voted
OL,8,Fagainst measures aimed at tackling
OL,9,FSpain's housing crisis
OL,11,FSanchez's government had presented the
OL,12,Fmeasures in response to nationwide
OL,13,Fprotests, triggered by the eviction of
OL,14,Fan 87-year-old woman from her home for
OL,15,Ffailing to pay a sharp rent increase
OL,17,FSanchez has been prime minister since
OL,18,F2018. Spain was not due to hold a
OL,19,Fgeneral election until summer 2027 -
OL,20,Fhere's what happened last time
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
